Support raw audio/video output in NUT container

Useful fallback when AVFoundation is absent e.g. on Linux, or you just wanted the
raw frames and audio.  Produces uncompressed rgb48le video and pcm_f32le audio in
the NUT container format:
https://git.ffmpeg.org/gitweb/nut.git/blob_plain/HEAD:/docs/nut.txt
which you can convert with ffmpeg or play with mpv/iina/ffplay. warning: big files
